## Interface: 16001
## Title: Upkeep
## Notes: Duration bar for your Paladin seal, a reminder when none of your own blessings is on you, and the blessings you could still cast on your target. Also reminds you of a missing weapon enchant or self buff for your class, and of Find Minerals or Find Herbs if you know Mining or Herbalism.
## Author: Martin
## Version: 2.8
